                "headline": "Special Weather Statement issued November 26 at 8:58PM AKST by NWS Anchorage AK",
                "description": "Freezing rain has been observed across portions of Anchorage and\nthe Seward Highway this evening. Freezing rain mixed with snow is\nexpected to continue over the next couple of hours until\ntemperatures aloft cool enough to transition precipitation to all\nsnow. Snow is expected overnight tonight through 9AM tomorrow\nmorning. Snow accumulations of 2 to 4 inches possible with little\nto no ice accumulation. Slippery conditions expected, use caution\nwhen driving.",
